---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="此刻" description="我现在在做什么">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-14 ink-reveal">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-sans tracking-[0.28em] text-accent dark:text-dark-accent border border-accent/25 dark:border-dark-accent/25 mb-5 uppercase">
        Now
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text dark:text-dark-text mb-3">
        此刻
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted dark:text-dark-text-muted font-serif text-sm leading-relaxed">
        这是{' '}
        <a
          href="https://nownownow.com/about"
          class="text-accent dark:text-dark-accent hover:underline"
        >
          /now page
        </a>
        ，一个告诉你我最近在做什么的页面。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Now items -->
    <div class="space-y-10 ink-reveal" style="animation-delay:0.15s">
      <!-- 在做 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-dark-text mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent dark:bg-dark-accent inline-block"></span>
          在做
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary dark:text-dark-text-secondary font-serif leading-relaxed list-none pl-0">
          <li class="pl-5 border-l-2 border-accent/15 dark:border-dark-accent/15">
            折腾这个博客 —— 从视觉到内容，一点点打磨一个不装的个人空间
          </li>
          <li class="pl-5 border-l-2 border-accent/15 dark:border-dark-accent/15">
            学 AI 工具的实际用法，不只是"会调用 API"，而是能把 AI 嵌入日常工作和创作流
          </li>
          <li class="pl-5 border-l-2 border-accent/15 dark:border-dark-accent/15">
            在闲鱼上接小单子补贴零花 —— 老照片修复、证件照、Excel 处理
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 在看 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-dark-text mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent/60 dark:bg-dark-accent/60 inline-block"></span>
          在看/在读
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary dark:text-dark-text-secondary font-serif leading-relaxed list-none pl-0">
          <li class="pl-5 border-l-2 border-accent/10 dark:border-dark-accent/10">
            各种独立博客，看别人怎么写、怎么设计、怎么生活
          </li>
          <li class="pl-5 border-l-2 border-accent/10 dark:border-dark-accent/10">
            研究怎么用 AI 真正提高效率，而不是被 AI 吆喝
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 用到的 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-dark-text mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent/30 dark:bg-dark-accent/30 inline-block"></span>
          常用工具
        </h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {[
            'Claude Code',
            'Astro',
            'VS Code',
            'GitHub',
            'Playwright',
            'Python',
            'Three.js',
            'Figma',
          ].map((t) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-sans text-text-muted dark:text-dark-text-muted border border-border/30 dark:border-dark-border/30 rounded-full">
              {t}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer note -->
    <div
      class="mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-border/15 dark:border-dark-border/15 ink-reveal"
      style="animation-delay:0.4s"
    >
      <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-dark-text-muted font-serif leading-relaxed">
        最后更新：2026年6月。
        <br />
        这个页面不定期更新，灵感来自{' '}
        <a href="https://sive.rs/now" class="text-accent dark:text-dark-accent hover:underline">
          Derek Sivers
        </a>
        。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
